    1 PRGSTART
    2 //A PROGRAM THAT IS NOTHING BUT THE TEN SECTIONS OF THE LOGIC//
    4 SECTION VARS,//WHERE EVERY NAME IN THE PROGRAM IS DECLARED//
    5 ENDSECT VARS
    7 SECTION INVALS,//WHAT RUNS ONCE BEFORE ANYTHING ELSE DOES//
    8 ENDSECT INVALS
   10 SECTION MAIN,//THE BODY OF THE PROGRAM//
   11 ENDSECT MAIN
   13 SECTION MAINSUBS,//SUBROUTINES THE BODY CALLS//
   14 ENDSECT MAINSUBS
   16 SECTION OPMACS,//ONE PIECE OF LOGIC PER OPERATION MACRO//
   17 ENDSECT OPMACS
   19 SECTION DEFSUBS,//SUBROUTINES USED WHILE A DEFINITION IS READ//
   20 ENDSECT DEFSUBS
   22 SECTION ERR,//WHAT TO DO WHEN SOMETHING IS WRONG//
   23 ENDSECT ERR
   25 SECTION ENVPR,//PRINTS THE STATE OF THE PROCESSOR//
   26 ENDSECT ENVPR
   28 SECTION MACNAMES,//THE NAMES THE OPERATION MACROS ANSWER TO//
   29 ENDSECT MACNAMES
   31 SECTION DELS,//DELIMITERS AND KEYWORDS//
   32 ENDSECT DELS
   34 PRGEND
